      "description": "The IRIS CDN Exporter's BPMN processes: initial load, nightly change ingest over DSpace REST, weekly reconciliation, and sign-and-publish; and the proposed GuidelineKG path (optimus-kg-nightly and its two phases, kg-tool-adjudication; docs/optimus-kg-integration.md), whose unbuilt steps say so with no-skill. Cloudflare git (Artifacts) and Cloudflare R2 + CDN are lanes: exports live on Cloudflare, and GitHub Pages only previews. Each activity names the skill that carries it out; the platform's nquads-distribution process is called, not copied. Rendered drawings: docs/assets/img/processes/.",
